{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46971","headline":"酬湘幕徐员外见寄 · 齐己","name":"酬湘幕徐员外见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东海儒宗事业全，冰棱孤峭类神仙。\n诗同李贺精通鬼，文拟刘轲妙入禅。\n珠履早曾从相府，玳簪今又别官筵。\n篇章几谢传西楚，空想雄风度十年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}